## Local-first reminder

The default runtime remains **rootless Podman**. A self-contained bundle is always
exported under `deploy/podman/`. Cluster manifests (Kubernetes, OKD, Argo CD, Terraform)
are optional and only included when their export flags are enabled (or when the graph
contains cluster swimlanes).

