## OKD / OpenShift

Full OKD package (Deployment, Service, Route, ImageStream, BuildConfig, NetworkPolicy)
under `deploy/okd/{namespace}/`:

```bash
{% if deployment.primary_target %}
oc apply -k deploy/okd/{{ deployment.primary_target.namespace }}/
{% else %}
for dir in deploy/okd/*/; do oc apply -k "$dir"; done
{% endif %}
```

See `deploy/okd/README.md`.
{% endif %}

